#: docs/api/_generated/objects/mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.rst:2
msgid "mecheye.area\\_scan\\_3d\\_camera.Camera"
msgstr "mecheye.area\\_scan\\_3d\\_camera.Camera"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera:3
msgid ""
"``Camera()`` requires explicit connect(). ``Camera(ip)`` remembers an IP and connects"
" on context entry or first convenience capture/configuration. "
"``Camera(other_camera)`` shares the native connection and callback registry. "
"Construction does not connect. Use a context manager or disconnect() to release a "
"connection; close() is the same operation."
msgstr ""
"``Camera()`` 需要显式调用 connect()。``Camera(ip)`` 记录 "
"IP，并在进入上下文或首次使用便捷采集／配置功能时连接。``Camera(other_camera)`` 共享原生连接和回调注册表。构造本身不会连接。使用上下文管理器或 "
"disconnect() 释放连接；close() 执行相同操作。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera:9
msgid ""
"SDK methods return ErrorStatus and never retry implicitly. Convenience methods raise "
"the MechEyeError subclasses from mecheye.shared on failure. SDK access is serialized "
"across camera instances; user code must synchronize writes to returned NumPy arrays "
"and to its own callback state."
msgstr ""
"SDK 方法返回 ErrorStatus，且不会隐式重试。便捷方法失败时抛出 mecheye.shared 中的 MechEyeError 子类异常。不同相机实例之间的 "
"SDK 访问会串行执行；调用者需要同步对返回的 NumPy 数组和自身回调状态的写入。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.discover_cameras:1
msgid "Discover cameras on reachable interfaces without connecting."
msgstr "在可访问的网络接口上发现相机，不建立连接。"

