#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.connect:1
msgid "Connect using an IP address or CameraInfo and an optional timeout."
msgstr "使用 IP 地址或 CameraInfo 连接，可指定超时时间。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.connect:3
msgid ""
"Accepted forms are ``connect(ip)`` and ``connect(info)``, with an optional second "
"positional ``timeoutMs`` argument (default 5000 milliseconds). The IP is remembered "
"after a successful connection. No retries are performed."
msgstr ""
"支持 ``connect(ip)`` 和 ``connect(info)``，第二个位置参数可指定 ``timeoutMs``，默认为 5000 毫秒。连接成功后记录 "
"IP。不会重试。"

