msgstr "断开连接并停止该连接的回调注册。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.disconnect:3
msgid ""
"Camera copies share the connection, so disconnecting one also affects the others. "
"This method can be called repeatedly."
msgstr "相机副本共享连接，因此断开一个副本也会影响其他副本。此方法可以重复调用。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.disconnect:6
