"Includes model, device name, serial number, SDK and firmware versions, IP address, "
"subnet mask, assignment method, port, and support information."
msgstr "包含型号、设备名称、序列号、SDK 与固件版本、IP 地址、子网掩码、地址分配方式、端口和支持信息。"

