#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.camera_parameters:1
msgid "Read camera matrices, distortion coefficients, and depth-to-texture transform."
msgstr "读取相机矩阵、畸变系数和深度坐标到纹理坐标的变换。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.camera_parameters:3
msgid ""
"The returned dictionary contains ``depth`` and ``texture`` dictionaries with flat "
"3-by-3 ``intrinsic_matrix`` values and five distortion coefficients. "
"``T_texture_camera_depth_camera_matrix_mm`` is a 4-by-4 nested list."
msgstr ""
"返回的字典包含 ``depth`` 和 ``texture`` 子字典，其中 ``intrinsic_matrix`` 是展开的 3×3 "
"内参矩阵，并包含五个畸变系数。``T_texture_camera_depth_camera_matrix_mm`` 是 4×4 嵌套列表。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.camera_parameters:7
msgid "The SDK cannot read the intrinsics."
msgstr "SDK 无法读取内参。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:1
msgid "Set and verify the depth-source 2D exposure mode."
msgstr "设置并验证深度源 2D 曝光模式。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:3
msgid "Either ``\"timed\"`` or ``\"flash\"``."
msgstr "``\"timed\"`` 或 ``\"flash\"``。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:4
msgid "The requested mode after successful device readback."
msgstr "设备读回验证成功后返回请求的模式。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:5
msgid "The mode is not supported."
msgstr "不支持该模式。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:6
msgid "The camera cannot be connected."
msgstr "无法连接相机。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.configure_depth_source_2d_exposure:7
msgid "Configuration or readback fails."
msgstr "配置或读回验证失败。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:1
msgid "Capture aligned grayscale and organized XYZ arrays in millimeters."
msgstr "采集对齐的灰度图和保留图像网格结构的 XYZ 数组，坐标单位为毫米。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:3
msgid ""
"Uses depth-source 2D and 3D capture, camera intrinsics, and SDK mapping. The camera "
"model must support depth-source 2D capture. An optional constructor IP enables lazy "
"connection; SDK capture errors are not retried."
msgstr "使用深度源 2D 与 3D 采集、相机内参和 SDK 映射。相机型号必须支持深度源 2D 采集。构造时指定 IP 可以延迟连接；SDK 采集错误不会重试。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:7
msgid "Capture timeout in milliseconds."
msgstr "采集超时，单位为毫秒。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:8
msgid ""
"``(image, points)`` with owned NumPy buffers. ``image`` has shape ``(height, width)``"
" and dtype ``uint8``; ``points`` has shape ``(height, width, 3)`` and dtype "
"``float64``. All-zero SDK points become NaN triplets; non-finite coordinate "
"components become NaN."
msgstr ""
"返回 ``(image, points)``，二者具有独立的 NumPy 缓冲区。``image`` 的形状为 ``(height, width)``，dtype 为 "
"``uint8``；``points`` 的形状为 ``(height, width, 3)``，dtype 为 ``float64``。SDK 全零点转换为三个 "
"NaN；非有限坐标分量转换为 NaN。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:12
msgid "Connection is unavailable."
msgstr "连接不可用。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:13
msgid "Capture, frame validation, or intrinsics fail."
msgstr "采集、帧校验或内参读取失败。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:14
msgid "Mapping fails or produces an invalid grid."
msgstr "映射失败或生成无效网格。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:15
msgid "Restoring the previous cloud unit fails."
msgstr "恢复先前的点云单位失败。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_points:17
msgid ""
"The previous cloud unit is restored after capture or mapping succeeds or fails. If "
"restoration itself fails, that configuration error is raised."
msgstr "无论采集或映射成功与否，都会恢复先前的点云单位。如果恢复操作本身失败，则抛出该配置错误。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.pop_callback_errors:1
msgid "Return and clear pending callback exceptions in registration context order."
msgstr "按注册上下文顺序返回并清空待处理的回调异常。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.pop_callback_errors:3
msgid ""
"Camera copies share the error queue. Exceptions are retained without printing. "
":return: A new list of exceptions."
msgstr "相机副本共享异常队列。异常会保留而不打印。:return: 新的异常列表。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.set_heartbeat_interval:1
msgid "Set the SDK heartbeat interval in milliseconds; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "设置 SDK 心跳间隔，单位为毫秒；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.get_camera_info:1
msgid "Fill the supplied CameraInfo with device metadata; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "将设备元数据写入提供的 CameraInfo；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.get_camera_status:1
msgid "Fill the supplied CameraStatus with temperatures; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "将温度写入提供的 CameraStatus；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.get_camera_resolutions:1
msgid "Fill the supplied CameraResolutions with image sizes; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "将图像尺寸写入提供的 CameraResolutions；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.current_user_set:1
msgid "Return a handle to the current device UserSet."
msgstr "返回当前设备 UserSet 的句柄。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.current_user_set:3
msgid ""
"Read and write operations on the handle report SDK status values. Obtain a new handle"
" after reconnecting or changing the selected configuration."
msgstr "句柄的读写操作反馈 SDK 状态值。重新连接或切换配置后应获取新的句柄。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.user_set_manager:1
msgid "Return the connection's UserSetManager for selecting and persisting user sets."
msgstr "返回该连接的 UserSetManager，用于选择和保存用户集。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_3d:1
msgid "Capture a 3D frame into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将 3D 帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d:3
#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d_and_3d:3
#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d_and_3d_with_normal:3
#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_3d:3
