msgid ""
"``timeoutMs`` is measured in milliseconds. The camera must already be connected; this"
" SDK operation does not initiate a connection or retry a failure. :return: "
"ErrorStatus; only read output data after is_ok() succeeds."
msgstr ""
"``timeoutMs`` 的单位为毫秒。相机必须已连接；此 SDK 操作不会建立连接或重试失败。:return: ErrorStatus；仅在 is_ok() "
"返回成功后读取输出数据。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_3d_with_normal:1
msgid "Capture a 3D frame with normals into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将带法向量的 3D 帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d:1
msgid "Capture a 2D frame into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将 2D 帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_depth_source_2d:1
msgid "Capture the depth-source 2D frame into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将深度源 2D 帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d_and_3d:1
msgid "Capture a combined texture 2D and 3D frame into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将纹理 2D 与 3D 组合帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_depth_source_2d_and_3d:1
msgid "Capture a combined depth-source 2D and 3D frame into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将深度源 2D 与 3D 组合帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_2d_and_3d_with_normal:1
msgid "Capture a combined 2D and 3D frame with normals into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将带法向量的 2D 与 3D 组合帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_stereo_2d:1
msgid "Capture left and right stereo 2D frames into the supplied output container."
msgstr "将左右立体 2D 帧采集到提供的输出容器。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.capture_stereo_2d:3
msgid ""
"``timeoutMs`` is measured in milliseconds. The camera must already be connected; this"
" SDK operation does not initiate a connection or retry a failure. :return: "
"ErrorStatus; only read output data after is_ok() succeeds. :param isRectified: "
"Whether the SDK should rectify the stereo images."
msgstr ""
"``timeoutMs`` 的单位为毫秒。相机必须已连接；此 SDK 操作不会建立连接或重试失败。:return: ErrorStatus；仅在 is_ok() "
"返回成功后读取输出数据。:param isRectified: SDK 是否应校正立体图像。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.set_point_cloud_unit:1
msgid "Set CoordinateUnit_Millimeter or CoordinateUnit_Meter; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "设置 CoordinateUnit_Millimeter 或 CoordinateUnit_Meter；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.save_virtual_device_file:1
msgid "Save a virtual-device file at fileName through the SDK; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "通过 SDK 将虚拟设备文件保存到 fileName；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.get_camera_intrinsics:1
msgid "Fill the supplied CameraIntrinsics with calibration values; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "将标定参数写入提供的 CameraIntrinsics；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.Camera.get_point_cloud_unit:1
msgid "Return ``[status, unit]`` for the SDK's current CoordinateUnit selection."
msgstr "返回 ``[status, unit]``，反映 SDK 当前选择的 CoordinateUnit。"

