#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent.get_supported_events:1
msgid "Fill eventInfos with supported EventInfo values; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "将支持的 EventInfo 写入 eventInfos；返回 ErrorStatus。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent.register_camera_event_callback:1
msgid "Register a callback for a connected camera and event identifier."
msgstr "为已连接相机的指定事件标识注册回调。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent.register_camera_event_callback:3
msgid ""
"Use ``(camera, event, callback)`` with EventCallbackBase.process_event() or "
"process_event_with_payload(). The four-argument form ``(camera, callback, user, "
"event)`` calls run(event_id); user is accepted but is not forwarded. CAMERA_EVENT_ALL"
" subscribes to all events."
msgstr ""
"``(camera, event, callback)`` 使用 EventCallbackBase.process_event() 或 "
"process_event_with_payload()。四参数形式 ``(camera, callback, user, event)`` 调用 "
"run(event_id)；接受 user 参数，但不会转发。CAMERA_EVENT_ALL 订阅所有事件。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent.register_camera_event_callback:8
msgid ""
"Event values are copied before Python dispatch. Callback exceptions are retained by "
"Camera.pop_callback_errors(). SDK calls in callbacks wait for other SDK calls to "
"finish. :return: ErrorStatus. :raises TypeError: The argument count or camera type is"
" invalid."
msgstr ""
"事件值会在 Python 分发前复制。回调异常由 Camera.pop_callback_errors() 保留。回调中的 SDK 调用会等待其他 SDK "
"调用完成。:return: ErrorStatus。:raises TypeError: 参数数量或相机类型无效。"

#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.CameraEvent.unregister_camera_event_callback:1
msgid "Unregister an event, or all events with CAMERA_EVENT_ALL; return ErrorStatus."
msgstr "注销指定事件，或使用 CAMERA_EVENT_ALL 注销所有事件；返回 ErrorStatus。"

