#: mecheye.area_scan_3d_camera.VectorCameraInfo:3
#: mecheye.shared.MechEyeVectorParameterPointer:3 mecheye.shared.MechEyeVectorROI:3
#: mecheye.shared.MechEyeVectorString:3
msgid ""
"Construct from a sequence, or a size and optional initial value. Value objects are "
"copied on insertion; parameter handles retain their camera ownership."
msgstr "从序列构造，或指定大小与可选初始值。插入时复制值对象；参数句柄保留相机所有权。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.append:1
msgid "Append a copied value; camera-owned parameter handles retain shared ownership."
msgstr "追加值的副本；相机所属的参数句柄保留共享所有权。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.assign:1
msgid "Replace the contents with n independent copies of value."
msgstr "将内容替换为 n 个独立的 value 副本。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.back:1
msgid "Return the last element; an empty vector raises IndexError."
msgstr "返回最后一个元素；空向量抛出 IndexError。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.begin:1
msgid "Return an iterator positioned at the first element."
msgstr "返回指向第一个元素的迭代器。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.capacity:1
msgid "Return the adapter's logical reserved capacity, at least the current size."
msgstr "返回适配器记录的逻辑预留容量，该值至少等于当前大小。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.clear:1
msgid "Remove all elements."
msgstr "移除所有元素。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.empty:1
msgid "Return whether the vector contains no elements."
msgstr "返回向量是否不包含元素。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.end:1
msgid "Return the one-past-end iterator; dereferencing it raises StopIteration."
msgstr "返回末尾后迭代器；解引用会抛出 StopIteration。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.erase:1
msgid "Erase one iterator element, or the half-open range first to last."
msgstr "删除一个迭代器元素，或删除 first 到 last 的左闭右开区间。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.erase:3
msgid "An iterator positioned at the first element following the erased range."
msgstr "指向被删除区间之后第一个元素的迭代器。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.extend:1
msgid "Append independent copies of values, retaining shared parameter handles."
msgstr "追加各值的独立副本，参数句柄保持共享。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.front:1
msgid "Return the first element; an empty vector raises IndexError."
msgstr "返回第一个元素；空向量抛出 IndexError。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.get_allocator:1
msgid "Return the Python element type used to create default values."
msgstr "返回用于构造默认值的 Python 元素类型。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.insert:1
msgid "Insert at an index or iterator position."
msgstr "在索引或迭代器位置插入。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.insert:3
msgid ""
"Use ``insert(position, value)`` to return an iterator to the inserted value. "
"``insert(position, count, value)`` inserts count copies and returns None."
msgstr ""
"``insert(position, value)`` 返回指向已插入值的迭代器。``insert(position, count, value)`` 插入 count "
"个副本并返回 None。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.iterator:1
msgid "Return an iterator starting at the first element."
msgstr "返回从第一个元素开始的迭代器。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.pop:1
msgid "Remove and return the indexed element; default to the last element."
msgstr "移除并返回指定索引的元素；默认操作最后一个元素。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.pop_back:1
msgid "Remove the last element."
msgstr "移除最后一个元素。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.rbegin:1
msgid "Return a reverse iterator positioned at the last element."
msgstr "返回指向最后一个元素的反向迭代器。"

#: mecheye._containers.MechEyeMapStringInt.rend:1 mecheye._containers.Vector.rend:1
msgid "Return the one-past-end reverse iterator."
msgstr "返回反向遍历的末尾后迭代器。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.reserve:1
msgid "Record a minimum logical capacity without allocating SDK storage."
msgstr "记录最小逻辑容量，不分配 SDK 存储空间。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.resize:1
msgid "Resize to n elements, copying value or default-constructed elements when growing."
msgstr "将大小调整为 n；增大时复制 value 或使用默认构造的元素。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.resize:3
msgid "n is negative."
msgstr "n 为负数。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.size:1
msgid "Return the number of stored elements."
msgstr "返回已存储元素的数量。"

#: mecheye._containers.Vector.swap:1
msgid "Exchange the contents of this vector and other."
msgstr "交换此向量与 other 的内容。"

